WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:31.768
All four coordinates are active. Is it semantic?

00:00:31.768 --> 00:01:09.260
Four questions, four different kinds of answer

00:01:09.260 --> 00:01:40.967
An active coordinate need not have a word label

00:01:40.967 --> 00:02:11.649
Predict weights instead of counting occurrences

00:02:11.649 --> 00:02:48.447
A word that was absent can receive weight

00:02:48.447 --> 00:03:22.542
Keep the expansion small enough to search

00:03:22.542 --> 00:03:53.888
The comparison operation settles a different choice

00:03:53.888 --> 00:04:36.400
Read the representation before judging the promise
